##Zap-Alert
OWASP ZAP Alerts (Passive Scan):

1. Missing Anti-clickjacking Header (Medium)
2. Cookie without SameSite Attribute (Low-Medium)
3. Server Leaks Version Information (Low)
4. X-Content-Type-Options Header Missing (Low)
5. Content Security Policy (CSP) Not Set (Medium)
6. Directory Browsing (Medium)
7. Application Error Disclosure (Low)
